comments[14]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-08-15T15:26:48.504Z","harness:codex","Duplicate-check evidence 2026-08-15: all-status searches for GH-1032, manifest unknown key, pm_min_version, compatibility.pm, and nested compatibility found no item for this silent manifest-schema gap. Closed pm-1w0d owns the existing compatibility analyzer and is linked as provenance; this item records the newly reported cross-package validation defect without reopening completed work."
  "2026-08-15T15:29:21.230Z","harness:codex","GitHub linkage evidence 2026-08-15: https://github.com/unbraind/pm-cli/issues/1032#issuecomment-5302914062 points GitHub #1032 to this canonical PM item after all-status duplicate checks and typed lineage enrichment."
  "2026-08-16T05:20:51.282Z","harness:codex","TDD red evidence: SDK manifest compatibility reported no findings for an ignored compatibility.pm spelling and no canonical pm_min_version/pm_max_version bounds. Command: node scripts/run-tests.mjs test -- tests/unit/sdk/extension-manifest-schema-contract.spec.ts."
  "2026-08-16T06:16:07.117Z","harness:codex","Green evidence: shared closed-schema inspection drives SDK findings and loader/doctor warnings; latest pm-changelog is 2026.8.12 and the installed project package is that version. package doctor now reports ok with zero warnings. SDK surface snapshot updated with an explicit compatibility-finding acknowledgement. Exact repository coverage is 100/100/100/100."
  "2026-08-16T07:05:15.416Z","harness:codex","Delivery: PR #1041 https://github.com/unbraind/pm-cli/pull/1041 carries this context-integrity tranche; initial implementation commit b9ef9470eed45b74353864743df5b4d4718a0bc4 passed local exact coverage and repository gates. Hosted exact-head checks and bot review are pending."
  "2026-08-16T07:22:52.963Z","harness:codex","Review TDD red evidence: unknown manifest keys sorted with host-locale semantics; locale-sensitive non-ASCII regression produced a different order than deterministic code-unit ordering."
  "2026-08-16T07:50:50.525Z","harness:codex","Final green evidence: locale-sensitive manifest regression and linked test passed; packed SDK consumer returned code-unit ordered paths; strict quality and exact 100/100/100/100 coverage passed."
  "2026-08-16T07:52:21.109Z","harness:codex","Changelog closeout: installed and activated latest pm-changelog 2026.8.16, regenerated CHANGELOG.md from 2,109 canonical closed items, and a deterministic --check pass reported unchanged output."
  "2026-08-16T08:07:09.885Z","harness:codex","Shipping reconciliation evidence: PR #1041 synthetic-merge CI reproduced a changelog mismatch because origin/main advanced to release commit cbc5ac21a (v2026.8.16) after the branch cut. Merged that exact release commit, regenerated with pm-changelog 2026.8.16, and the deterministic check plus linked manifest regression now pass on the reconciled tree."
  "2026-08-16T08:14:23.634Z","harness:codex","Hosted/static contract TDD evidence: after changelog parity passed, pnpm contracts:check rejected the generator-owned catalog because manifest_unknown_key and no_version_bounds_declared were absent; regenerating those entries correctly made the full runtime contract snapshot stale at line 17145, proving both public artifacts are gated."
  "2026-08-16T08:18:59.655Z","harness:codex","Generated-contract green evidence: regenerated manifest_unknown_key and no_version_bounds_declared into both catalog partitions, refreshed the full runtime contract snapshot, and linked all generator-owned artifacts. pnpm contracts:check, full pnpm lint (including static assurance/docstring/graph/record gates), pnpm security:scan, and the linked manifest regression all pass."
  "2026-08-16T08:29:49.530Z","harness:codex","Review TDD plan: prove a recognized-only unbounded manifest receives the missing-bounds diagnostic independently of unknown-key detection, then preserve bounded negative controls."
  "2026-08-16T08:32:26.735Z","harness:codex","Review TDD red evidence: recognized-only unbounded manifest produced zero findings; expected no_version_bounds_declared. Focused suite failed before implementation."
  "2026-08-16T08:57:30.003Z","harness:codex","Final review-hardening green evidence: recognized-only unbounded manifests now emit no_version_bounds_declared independently in SDK and runtime paths; valid unrelated fixtures declare an explicit floor and dedicated no-bounds tests preserve advisory coverage. The linked test and 513 affected regressions passed, followed by 7,404 repository tests at exact 100/100/100/100 plus lint, static assurance, secret, docs, contracts, and package gates."
